Reading a single course's bookings is its own step because two callers need it:
the flat accumulator above, and the planning sheet, which must keep each
course's bookings separate (see \cref{sec:amanuensis-course-rows}).  A course
without a configured sign-up sheet contributes no bookings rather than aborting
the loop --- we log it and leave [[course_bookings]] empty, so one
misconfigured course never hides the others.
